            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Nevermind. I realized what I was looking for was to force linewise mode\r\n\r\nSure, this is already supported.\r\n\r\nHowever, returning different region depending on the operator is also technically possible, as specification [allows callable objects](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/334a2d9cfbd86ea08c4d870e39b5ba8bb354d938/doc/mini-ai.txt#L251). Thus the returned region/pattern can be conditioned on `vim.v.operator` (see `:h v:operator`), but beware of doing so only in Operator-pending mode (not Visual).",
